\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">1. 신청자격 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 본교 재학생(휴학생 불가)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 타교 학생중 소속대학 총장의 추천을 받은 자</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 7pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2. 수업기간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0066ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2009. 12. 21(월) ~ 2010. 1. 12(화)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">3. 수강료 : 학점당 25,000원</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">4. 수강가능학점 :</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 6학점 이내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;바탕체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">5. 수업시간표(강의계획서)열람 :</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;바탕체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 금오공과대학교 홈페이지(</span><a href=\"http://kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;바탕체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">http://kumoh.ac.kr</span></a><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;바탕체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;바탕체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">