 MARGIN-LEFT: 46pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;( </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">원스톱서비스 - 수업 - 계절학기 수강신청 입력</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -46pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 46pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 수강료 환불계좌(본인명의)를</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 반드시 입력하여야 함.)</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -46pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 46pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▸선수과목 대상 교과목 확인 후 수강신청</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -42pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▸수강신청인원에 따라 일부 강좌가 분반될 수 있음.</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">(수강신청 선착순에 의해&nbsp; 분반 처리되며,</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">해당 강좌가 분반될 경우 담당교원이 변경될 수 있음.)<br><br><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/FCKeditor/editor/images/smiley/msn/regular_smile.gif\">&nbsp;<font color=\"#ff0000\">일반화학1&nbsp; 시간표 변경되었습니다. 6~8교시에 수업합니다</font></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">&nbsp;▸</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: